; Minimal HUD — four chrome strips (top/bottom/left/right) are cropped
; directly from the DOSBox reference so frame-0 pixel-diff against the
; original lands cleanly. Reference gameplay viewport is 288x165 inside
; the chrome (x=16..304, y=19..184); the clone renders gameplay across
; the full 320x200 and the chrome strips mask the portions that would
; otherwise be visible gameplay in the reference's chrome region.

